    title: "Prince Leopold and Celeste Marlowe Set a Date—and a Cathedral",
    dek: "The royal wedding will take place at St. Brigid's in Lindholm in May. The guest list is already causing headaches, and one decision has delighted Hollywood and horrified the protocol office.",
