    title: "The Juniper Summit: Billionaire Summer Camp, Decoded",
    dek: "Every July, the most powerful people in media and tech descend on a resort in Idaho for a week of hiking, whitewater rafting and deals worth billions. Here's what really happens.",
    rubric: "Society",
    section: "business",
    authors: ["henry-blackwood", "clara-lindqvist"],
